00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:05,540
Boron carbide has a hardness approaching that of diamond.

547
00:31:06,220 --> 00:31:09,540
It has a stiffness factor that's twice that of armor-grade steel.

548
00:31:09,541 --> 00:31:13,980
And those properties are what really come into play

549
00:31:13,981 --> 00:31:17,740
when the projectile impacts that ceramic hard facing.

