568
00:32:22,080 --> 00:32:26,220
Boron carbide armor is a ceramic formed from boron carbide grit.

569
00:32:26,221 --> 00:32:32,700
It's not a naturally occurring mineral, but has to be synthetically created by combining

570
00:32:32,701 --> 00:32:35,000
