737
00:42:24,560 --> 00:42:26,220
do everything we dreamed of as kids.

738
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:31,140
The vertigo has come a long way from the pogo sticks

739
00:42:31,141 --> 00:42:33,360
that first bounced onto the scene in 1918

740
00:42:33,361 --> 00:42:36,220
from their unlikely place of origin, Burma.

741
00:42:36,221 --> 00:42:39,640
Legend has it that there was a German backpacker

742
00:42:39,641 --> 00:42:42,460
that stumbled upon a farmer and his daughter

743
00:42:42,461 --> 00:42:45,100
in the countryside, and the farmer had made

744
00:42:45,101 --> 00:42:46,800
a little hopping stick for his daughter

745
00:42:46,801 --> 00:42:49,080
to get to the temple every morning along this trail

746
00:42:49,081 --> 00:42:50,880
that had some rocks and mud on it.

747
00:42:50,881 --> 00:42:52,840
Well, this little girl's name was Pogo

748
00:42:52,841 --> 00:42:56,820
and took the idea back to Germany and added a spring to it

749
00:42:56,821 --> 00:42:58,280
and made the very first Pogo stick

750
00:42:58,281 --> 00:43:01,660
out of a wooden configuration with a metal spring.

751
00:43:01,661 --> 00:43:07,540
The toy maker, George Hansberg, received a patent for his gravity-defying gizmo.

752
00:43:09,800 --> 00:43:15,500
Since its arrival, pogo enthusiasts have been performing what seemed like amazing sidewalk stunts,

753
00:43:15,740 --> 00:43:17,940
like jumping rope or hopping upstairs.

754
00:43:19,920 --> 00:43:21,520
Then came vertigo.

755
00:43:22,220 --> 00:43:26,820
Its air spring blew the faithful away when it first appeared at Pogo Palooza,

756
00:43:27,300 --> 00:43:29,200
an annual event that celebrates the sport.

757
00:43:29,201 --> 00:43:34,200
It immediately raised the performance bar to new heights.

758
00:43:34,201 --> 00:43:38,200
Kids are already doing flips on them and progressing the sport

759
00:43:38,201 --> 00:43:42,200
and really going big, bigger than anyone's ever gone on a pogo stick before,

760
00:43:42,201 --> 00:43:45,200
and that's going to continue to evolve in that same direction.

761
00:43:45,201 --> 00:43:51,200
The pogo high jump in the Olympics, the 50-yard pogo, maybe pogo rockets.

762
00:43:51,201 --> 00:43:54,200
I don't know. The sky's the limit.

763
00:43:54,201 --> 00:43:57,940
Strength seems to have no limits.

764
00:43:58,040 --> 00:44:01,500
Industry and technology evolve, just like creatures in nature,

765
00:44:01,600 --> 00:44:04,140
and the strong survive.

766
00:44:04,240 --> 00:44:06,140
Perhaps it's just a matter of time

767
00:44:06,240 --> 00:44:08,840
before more powerful versions come along.

768
00:44:08,940 --> 00:44:11,860
But for now, we'll see you next time.

769
00:44:11,960 --> 00:44:13,260
We'll see you next time.

